  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know the binomial expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p>Using the above expansion,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>12</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>13</mn></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>0</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>12</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>13</mn></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>12</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>13</mn></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>13</mn></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Therefore, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math> is&nbsp;an even integer, hence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is even</p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>8</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>9</mn></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>9</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math>Now let,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>9</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>8</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>9</mn></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>9</mn></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo></math> Even integer hence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mfenced></math> is even</p>",
